^{:go/end 151} (go/func isTest "isTest tells whether name looks like a test, example, fuzz test, or\nbenchmark. It is a Test (say) if there is a character after Test that is not\na lower-case letter. (We don't want Testiness.)\n" ^bool [^string name ^string prefix]
